
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetVehicleRotationParam(ParameterName: number, ParameterValue: rotation)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSetVehicleRotationParam(integer ParameterName, rotation ParameterValue);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Sets the vehicle rotation parameter <b>param</b> to <b>rot</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>ParameterName / param</td>
          <td>VEHICLE_* flag</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>rotation</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>rotation</span></td>
          <td>ParameterValue / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/rot" target="_blank">rot</a></td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>vehicles</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">235</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Constant</th>
        <th></th>
        <th>Description</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/VEHICLE_REFERENCE_FRAME" target="_blank">VEHICLE_REFERENCE_FRAME</a></td>
        <td>44</td>
        <td>rotation of vehicle axes relative to local frame</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
  <p>The reference frame can be computed and set in two steps:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Place the vehicle with front facing east(red arrow) and with left side facing north(green arrow)</li>
    <li>llSetVehicleRotationParam( <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/VEHICLE_REFERENCE_FRAME" target="_blank">VEHICLE_REFERENCE_FRAME</a>, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ZERO_ROTATION" target="_blank">ZERO_ROTATION</a> / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetRootRotation" target="_blank">llGetRootRotation</a>());</li>
  </ul>
